|-----------|--------|--------|--------|---------------|----------|
| Bump | 0 | 0 | −10,300 | 10,300 | 2.5g |
| Braking | −4,945 | 0 | 0 | 4,945 | 1.2g |
| Cornering | 0 | +6,181 | 0 | 6,181 | 1.5g |
| Combined | −4,945 | +6,181 | −10,300 | 13,007 | — |

*Forces applied at hub bore centre. Positive X = forward, 
Positive Y = outboard lateral, Positive Z = upward.*

